OL,3,GNEWSAUpgrades to A38 set to cause
OL,4,Adelays for drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being warned to expect
OL,7,Fdisruption on a major route into the
OL,8,FSouth West.
OL,10,FMore than #26m of improvements - to
OL,11,Fcover nine locations between Barrow
OL,12,FTanks and the M5 at Edithmead - have
OL,13,Fbeen approved for the A38.
OL,15,FMajor changes are planned at junctions,
OL,16,Fincluding turning Edithmead Roundabout
OL,17,Finto a 'through-about' to increase
OL,18,Fcapacity and reduce queues.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
