OL,3,GNEWSAUpgrades to A38 set to cause
OL,4,Adelays for drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoads minister Justin Madders said:
OL,7,F"Journeys will be more reliable with
OL,8,Fless congestion and [it will be] safer
OL,9,Ffor pedestrians and cyclists through
OL,10,Fwider paths and new crossings."
